B.awl=new A.pm("Adam","\u0622\u062f\u0645","Quran 2:30\u201339","Allah created Adam, taught him the names of things, and commanded the angels to prostrate to him. Iblis refused. Adam and his wife ate from the tree they were told to avoid. They asked Allah to forgive them, and He turned to them. That is the pattern of this religion: a mistake, then a return.","What did Adam say when he wanted forgiveness, and what does that teach a child who has done something wrong?")
B.awn=new A.pm("Nuh","\u0646\u0648\u062d","Quran 11:25\u201349","Nuh called his people for a long time. Most of them mocked him. Allah told him to build the ark, and the flood took those who refused the message. His own son would not board. Nuh called to him, and the son said he would climb a mountain. The wave came between them. Guidance is not inherited. Each person answers for himself.","Why could Nuh not save his son, even though Nuh was a prophet?")
B.awk=new A.pm("Ibrahim","\u0625\u0628\u0631\u0627\u0647\u064a\u0645","Quran 21:51\u201370 and 2:127","Ibrahim asked his people why they worshipped idols that cannot hear or help. He broke the idols and left the largest one, so they would have to think about who really acts. They threw him into a fire, and Allah made it cool and safe for him. Later he and Ismail raised the foundations of the Kaaba and asked Allah to accept it from them.","Ibrahim left the biggest idol standing. What question was he forcing his people to ask?")
B.awh=new A.pm("Yusuf","\u064a\u0648\u0633\u0641","Surah Yusuf","Yusuf told his father a dream of eleven stars, the sun, and the moon prostrating to him. His brothers threw him into a well. He was sold, tested in the house he served, and put in prison though he was innocent. In prison he called people to Allah and later interpreted the king's dream. He was raised over the storehouses of Egypt, and years later he was reunited with his family. He did not take revenge on his brothers.","Which part of Yusuf's life was hardest, and where do you see him still trusting Allah?")
B.awi=new A.pm("Musa","\u0645\u0648\u0633\u0649","Quran 20:9\u201379 and 28:7\u201313","Musa's mother placed him in the river because Pharaoh was killing the boys. Pharaoh's household took him in, and Allah returned him to his mother to nurse. As a man, Allah spoke to him in the valley and sent him to Pharaoh with his brother Harun. Pharaoh refused. Allah split the sea for Musa and those who believed, and closed it on Pharaoh's army.","Musa was afraid to speak to Pharaoh. What did he ask Allah for before he went?")
B.awj=new A.pm("Isa","\u0639\u064a\u0633\u0649","Quran 19:16\u201336","The angels gave Maryam news of a son. She conceived Isa without a father, by Allah's word. As an infant he spoke and said he was a servant of Allah, given the scripture, and commanded to pray and give charity. He is a messenger, not a son of Allah. The Quran says Allah is far above having a child.","What did Isa say about himself when he first spoke, and how is that different from calling him divine?")
B.awm=new A.pm("Muhammad","\u0645\u062d\u0645\u062f","Quran 96:1\u20135 and the seerah",'At forty, in the cave of Hira, the Prophet Muhammad \ufdfa received the first words of the Quran: "Read in the name of your Lord who created." He was unlettered. Khadijah believed him first. The call moved from a few people in Makkah to the Hijrah, then to the opening of Makkah, and he died in Madinah after delivering the message in full. He is the last messenger.','The first command he received was "Read." What does that say about learning in this religion?')
B.a2c=A.a(s([B.awl,B.awn,B.awk,B.awh,B.awi,B.awj,B.awm]),A.ag("B<pm>"))
